chefs and home cooks.

298
00:23:46,321 --> 00:23:51,420
Despite the egg whites having already passed inspection at their original source, Eggology

299
00:23:51,421 --> 00:23:56,640
runs them through another round of safety checks, particularly because so many buyers

300
00:23:56,641 --> 00:23:58,920
drink the product uncooked.

301
00:23:58,921 --> 00:24:03,680
A USDA inspector continually monitors production.

302
00:24:03,681 --> 00:24:10,680
A proprietary, non-chemical, all-natural process adds a unique characteristic to these egg whites.

303
00:24:10,681 --> 00:24:15,680
A four-month shelf life, twice that of normal liquid eggs.

304
00:24:15,681 --> 00:24:19,680
Because we're a USDA plant, we have to substantiate anything that's on that label.

305
00:24:19,681 --> 00:24:22,680
So if we're going to claim four months, we have to prove it continuously.

306
00:24:22,681 --> 00:24:29,680
So out of every day's production, we pull samples, and four months later, we have to open up a sample in front of our inspector.

307
00:24:29,681 --> 00:24:37,680
Eggology has taken the concept of only egg white protein into uncharted territory with

308
