00:24:59,161 --> 00:25:05,340
ready to become nuke scrambled in 90 seconds without even taking the top off.

313
00:25:05,341 --> 00:25:09,760
While the bodybuilders and egg white lovers of California work to create new forms of

314
00:25:09,761 --> 00:25:17,320
designer eggs, back in the egg production capital of Iowa, the art of egg eating is a bit more

315
00:25:17,321 --> 00:25:20,160
traditional.

316
00:25:20,161 --> 00:25:25,640
The place to eat eggs in Iowa City is the Hamburg Inn 2.

317
00:25:25,641 --> 00:25:29,920
a major stop on the Iowa caucus political highway the walls are lined

318
00:25:29,921 --> 00:25:36,640
with pictures of winners and losers who came to the end to get votes and eat eggs

319
00:25:36,641 --> 00:25:40,580
so what causes the hungry crowds to gather every morning starting at

