420
00:33:12,821 --> 00:33:17,140
They've been serving them for more than 40 years.

421
00:33:17,141 --> 00:33:22,080
is best known for its French dip roast beef sandwiches, but regular customers frequently

422
00:33:22,081 --> 00:33:24,811
add a pickled egg to their platters.

423
00:33:24,812 --> 00:33:28,680
The eggs originally became popular as bar snacks in

424
00:33:28,681 --> 00:33:33,735
